  "summary": "Running stitch embroidery creating narrative patterns on recycled fabrics.",
  "description": "Features intricate figurative patterns, animals, and scenes using simple running stitch on layers of old saris; traditionally created by rural women as quilts and household items, often telling stories from daily life and mythology. The technique represents sustainable practices as it repurposes worn textiles into new functional and decorative pieces.",
